#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-dependencies/semantic_version.xml:27
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>semantic_version</application> module brings a small "
"library to handle the standard for <ulink "
"url=\"http://semver.org/\">Semantic Versioning</ulink> in Python."
